load @term/seed/code/type/term
  find term

# Type theory, the foundation of mathematics this library is checked in, an alternative to set theory where the
# primitive is the typed term rather than the untyped set. A proposition is a type and a proof is a term inhabiting it,
# so checking a proof is type-checking. The committed stack is a quantitative dependent type theory (multiplicities tie
# erasure, linearity, and uniqueness into one), with a predicative cumulative universe-polymorphic hierarchy, self types
# for inductive data, and observational equality. Its files are in the type folder. The form carries the kernel's term
# language; the judgments and the four layers (surface, refinement, kernel, equality) are developed there.
form type-theory
  link term, like term
